      "data": {
        "text": "**Constructing Client & Models**\n\nI've made progress on the support files. Specifically, I am now focused on `translation_client.py` and `translation_models.py`. The models file is slated to define the `TranslationRequest` and `TranslationResponse` data structures, providing the required inputs and outputs for my translation logic.\n\n\n**Defining Data Structures**\n\nI've shifted my attention to `translation_models.py` and am working on defining the `TranslationRequest` and `TranslationResponse` data structures. The client file, `translation_client.py`, is next, and I'll keep its configuration minimal for now, focusing on API key loading. It should have a placeholder, just in case.\n\n\n",
