        "text": "**Initiating The Next Phase**\n\nNow that the initial groundwork is laid with the first scored file and supporting files generated, I'm shifting focus to the remaining \"same-scenario\" scored files. Specifically, I'll be developing `batch_translate.py` to handle ordered string translation via OpenAI and then crafting `translate_markup.py` to tackle HTML and markup translation, maintaining structural integrity.\n\n\n**Developing Batch Translation**\n\nI'm now focusing on `batch_translate.py`. My approach mirrors `translate_text.py` but will handle a list of texts using the OpenAI Chat Completions API. This should streamline translation across multiple entries.\n\n\n",
