        "text": "**Defining Translation Tool**\n\nOkay, I'm moving forward with defining `translate_markup.py`. The focus will be translating HTML/markup while ensuring the preservation of the original tags. I'll be prompting the OpenAI model to maintain the HTML structure throughout the translation. I believe this will provide a reliable outcome.\n\n\n",
