        "text": "**Initiating Code Translation**\n\nI'm now creating `translate_dictionary_values.py`, aiming to translate dictionary values while keeping the keys intact. I plan to use the OpenAI model to produce a JSON object containing the translated values. This should make it easy to process the information.\n\n\n",
